 what he calls final  processing where the stonehenge particle  microchip is implanted it seems at some  point during his tour mr grimbridge  discovered what really goes on in final  processing and made it his goal to warn  the public about it so cochran sends one  of his androids to hunt him down with  instructions to kill grimbridge and then  self-destruct of course this raises a  lot of eyebrows around the scene of the  accident and eventually on october 29th  mr grimbridge's doctor and his daughter  show up in sanamira looking for answers  about his untimely death  they set themselves up at a local motel  not yet knowing that this was a part of  cochran's area of influence seemingly  everybody in town is enamored with him  as if he were someone like walt disney a  sort of magical wonder others like marge  guptman who is also there to pick up a  shipment are annoyed with him and his  big business tactics cochran's plan for  dealing with the doctor daniel chalice  and the daughter ellie grimbridge is  essentially sweep everything under the  rug and pretend that harry picked up his  order and went on his way this is  complicated however when marge gutman  gets curious about the chip that she  discovers in the back of the silver  shamrock trademark attached to each mask  and prides at it with a hairpin causing  it to misfire blowing a hole through her  face with a laser and causing bugs to  come crawling out he sends his androids  to clean up the mess and cochran himself  is even forced to come out and assess  the situation in the middle of the night  where he meets ellie and chalice for the  first time he assures them that miss  gutman is going to be sent to the  factory where they supposedly have  excellent medical facilities but chalice  being a doctor himself isn't really  buying it i mean why would a mask and  toy factory have its own hospital i mean  that's just asking for a lawsuit this  isn't a great excuse from cochran to be  honest and i think at this point he was  just so close to halloween and achieving  his goal that he figured he could tell  them anything and it would buy him  enough time to finish carrying out his  plans he even tries to act hospitable  the next day when they show up at the  factory by inviting chalice and ellie  along as he gives another tour this time  to buddy kupper and his family a mass  store owner and the number one silver  shamrock salesman in the country before  going on the tour chalice introduces  himself and ellie as mr and mrs smith  which cochran already knows is not true  because he's had an eye on them for a  while and knows exactly who they are and  why they're here he wants to send them  away peacefully though so he makes a big  spectacle by offering to replace mr  grimbridge's lost odor for free hoping  to distract them from the possibility  that his factory had anything to do with  harry's death  about the confusion over your order i  just tell you one thing a replacement  order is being prepared for you  absolutely free the whole thing's on me  he also has a big mural of himself right  behind him so between those two things  in fact that he basically made himself a  mayor of a town of robots the man seemed  to have a pretty fragile ego perhaps he  should have spent less time  congratulating himself and more time  hiding evidence because ellie at one  point spots her father's car in plain  sight and immediately knows that this is  where he ran into trouble before they  can get out of town and sound the alarm  he has some of his rowboys kidnap ellie  at this point for reasons that are still  entirely unclear to me cochrane creates  a robot version of ellie i guess if i'm  gonna try to put a reasoning behind this  he did this as a backup plan to maybe  try to stop chalice if he's somehow able  to escape the town and try to warn the  public about the silver shamrock mass in  any event it's pretty impressive that  he's able to create a perfect robot  replica of her in just one day he sends  his bots after chalice too but he sneaks  away out of their grasp and goes to the  factory to try to save ellie cochran  quickly learns of the intrusion and goes  to find one of his androids has been  dismantled by chalice and his knitting  woman animatronic decapitated this time  when he sees his intruder he doesn't  bother with entertaining the false name  that he gave last time ah mr cellis  where is ellie  mrs smith he takes chalice prisoner  overnight so the next day is halloween  and cochran takes a moment to appreciate  and breathe in that fresh autumn hair he  knows that this is his big day and he's  about to gain an immeasurable amount of  power he takes chalice down to the final  processing area now i know evil  monologues where the bad guy explains  his entire plan before it's too late for  the hero to do anything about it or a  common movie trope because the audience  needs to understand what's going on and  that's an easy way to do it so that's  probably why he essentially reveals  everything to dr chalice but on the  other hand i'm here to analyze his  character so let's look at why he might  have done this i imagine that the man  lived a very lonely life he secludes  himself up to a small town in northern  california where he's surrounded  entirely by robots with very little  personality he's been alive for probably  thousands of years all of his original  friends and family have most likely  passed at this point and if any of them  have survived like he has i imagine that  they're all the way back in ireland  cochran seems to be a classic case of  the lonely at the top ceo this probably  explains why he puts on the act of being  overly hospitable when people come to  pick up the orders and why he enjoys  giving tours of the factory the man is  starved for human interaction so he  decides to get the most out of chalice  before killing him by explaining his  entire plan that probably also explains  why he remains so friendly with the man  who's trying to expose him and take him  down he even shows chalice a  demonstration of the power bestowed  inside of each silver shamrock halloween  mask when the planets are aligned  properly the cup for family who he had  given a tour of the day before is placed  inside of a test room and a version of  the silver shamrock advert is played  causing the young cover boy to pass out  as his insides are turned into a horde  of crawling insects and aggressive  servants he leaves chalice tied up in  another test room that evening and  places a mask over his face planning to  let the silver shamrock commercial do  the rest of the work and  happy halloween  cochrane goes back to his command center  at final processing where he makes a few  last-minute phone calls and tells  someone that the halloween giveaway is  just gonna be a fun thank you for his  customers when he's informed of a camera  malfunction in chalice's room he sends  his drones in where they discover that  their prisoner has escaped but he shows  no concern because he's already got a  plan b he simply watches as chalice goes  to save what he thinks is ellie but is  actually robo ellie who is programmed to  kill him if he manages to escape however  dr chalice doesn't act as cochran  expected him to instead of leaving the  factory he sneaks back into the final  processing room and starts playing the  commercial internally he sees chalice  scurrying away and sends his androids  after him as he climbs up above the  ceiling raptors where he dumps an entire  box full of mass trademarks down onto  the factory floor while the commercial  is blasting through the television  monitors this activates each of the  buttons and the part of stonehenge  residing in the factory the interference  causes all of the robots in the area to  malfunction and fall to the ground yet  still cochran doesn't seem concerned  thrown off or even frustrated at his  plans being thwarted in fact he seems  quite the opposite he gives chalice a  slow clap as he does so the stone zaps  him and he seemingly turns to stone  himself which looks like either  something out of a nightmare or  something out of a hilarious meme then  he completely disappears he doesn't burn  up or turn into a swarm of bugs like the  victims that we had previously seen  there's still some debate as to what  happened here did cochran use the  witchcraft that he was so familiar with  to teleport himself out of the factory  or was the beam coming directly from the  stonehenge monument itself so powerful  that it essentially zapped him out of  existence personally i read this as the  death of connell cochran but to be  honest we'll probably never find out for  sure since it's been 40 years with no  more halloween spin-off movies and the  great diana harrelly who played conal  cochran in the film is no longer with us  that being said i'd definitely be in  favor of them making a movie called  halloween 3-2 so if you're watching this  universal let's make that happen that  will conclude today's lesson but let me  know what other halloween characters  you'd like to see covered here on horror  history subscribe to cz's world for new  horrors every week ring that death bell  and make sure you select all  notifications and i'll see you in the  next one assuming we both survive  [Music]
 

